{{define "content"}}<section class="learner">
  <h1>学習</h1>

  <h2>優先項目</h2>
  <div class="table-card table-card--stack">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>対象</th><th>種類</th><th>スコア</th><th>理由</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        {{range .Priorities}}<tr>
          <td data-label="対象">{{.Subject}}</td>
          <td data-label="種類"><span class="badge badge--type">{{.SubjectType}}</span></td>
          <td data-label="スコア">{{printf "%.1f" .Score}}</td>
          <td data-label="理由">{{.Reason}}</td>
        </tr>{{else}}<tr><td colspan="4" class="empty">優先項目がありません</td></tr>{{end}}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2>観察</h2>
  <div class="table-card table-card--stack">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>対象</th><th>種類</th><th>状態</th><th>信頼度</th><th>最終更新</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        {{range .Observations}}<tr>
          <td data-label="対象">{{.Subject}}</td>
          <td data-label="種類"><span class="badge badge--type">{{.SubjectType}}</span></td>
          <td data-label="状態">{{.Kind}}</td>
          <td data-label="信頼度">{{percent .Confidence}}%</td>
          <td data-label="最終更新">{{.UpdatedAt.Format "2006-01-02"}}</td>
        </tr>{{else}}<tr><td colspan="5" class="empty">観察がありません</td></tr>{{end}}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2>復習キュー</h2>
  {{/* Whole-branch review C-1, the functional half: the scheduler is
       driven by correction.retried / quiz.answered /
       vocabulary.produced-correctly, and a conversation correction has
       no retry route, so a grammar concept the learner got wrong IN
       SPEECH is never scheduled here. Vocabulary IS covered (the
       conversation path does publish vocabulary.produced-correctly),
       which is exactly what makes the grammar hole easy to misread as
       "nothing due". Said plainly rather than left to be inferred from
       an empty table. */}}
  <p class="description">
    復習予定は、<strong>添削・クイズ・語彙の正用</strong>から作られます。会話練習と音声練習で指摘された<strong>文法</strong>は、
    まだこのキューには入りません（語彙は入ります）。
  </p>
  <div class="table-card table-card--stack">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>対象</th><th>種類</th><th>期日</th><th>間隔</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        {{range .Retrieval}}<tr>
          <td data-label="対象">{{.Subject}}</td>
          <td data-label="種類"><span class="badge badge--type">{{.SubjectType}}</span></td>
          <td data-label="期日">{{.DueAt.Format "2006-01-02"}}</td>
          <td data-label="間隔">{{days .Interval}}日</td>
        </tr>{{else}}<tr><td colspan="4" class="empty">復習予定がありません</td></tr>{{end}}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2>エージェント利用</h2>
  <div class="table-card table-card--stack">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>エージェント</th><th>リクエスト数</th><th>成功率</th><th>平均レイテンシ (ms)</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        {{range .AgentUsage}}<tr>
          <td data-label="エージェント">{{if .Agent}}{{.Agent}}{{else}}未分類{{end}}</td>
          <td data-label="リクエスト数">{{.Requests}}</td>
          <td data-label="成功率">{{percent .SuccessRate}}%</td>
          <td data-label="平均レイテンシ (ms)">{{.AvgLatencyMS}}</td>
        </tr>{{else}}<tr><td colspan="4" class="empty">利用データがありません</td></tr>{{end}}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2>システム</h2>
  <div class="stat-grid">
    <div class="stat"><span class="stat__value">{{.System.LearningEvents}}</span><span class="stat__label">学習イベント</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><span class="stat__value">{{.System.AIRequests}}</span><span class="stat__label">AIリクエスト</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="table-card">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>種類</th><th>件数</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        {{range $type, $count := .System.EventsByType}}<tr><td>{{$type}}</td><td>{{$count}}</td></tr>{{else}}<tr><td colspan="2" class="empty">データがありません</td></tr>{{end}}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</section>{{end}}
